  "reasoning": "The defendant, Wang, was the party branch secretary of a village and used his position to receive large sums of money from a real estate developer during the construction of a new village. This constitutes acceptance of bribes in exchange for using his official position, which is defined under Chinese criminal law as the crime of bribery (受贿). No other illegal conduct such as abuse of power beyond the bribery is indicated, so the appropriate charge is solely bribery.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿<eoa>"
}
